### Create a new parent
POST http://localhost:8080/api/parents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Robert Smith",
  "phoneNumber": "5551112222",
  "email": "robert.smith@example.com"
}

### Get all parents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parents

### Get a parent by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parents/1

### Update a parent
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/parents/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Robert Smith Updated",
  "phoneNumber": "5553334444",
  "email": "robert.smith.updated@example.com"
}

### Delete a parent
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/parents/1